WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:47.560
¡Ay-ay-ay!

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:49.480
When will I finally

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.600
get to see your face, lady?

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.400
Business is business.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.880
Let's get down to it.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.640
Oh, business lady.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:58.360
I like it.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:00:59.440
Okay, good.

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.720
I got good news.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.200
Everything is ready to ship.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.520
Waiting for the signal.

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:06.080
Same delivery address?

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.080
Yes.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.760
And it’s vital it goes out tonight.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.440
Because that way, it’ll be processed

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:11.760
by the customs shift officer

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:12.760
I know.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:15.840
As you wish. Okay, and...

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:18.240
...is already with my trusted person.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.320
As soon as I'll confirm

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.240
the shipment has been delivered,

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:23.440
you'll get your payment.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.760
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:28.240
Pleasure doing business with you.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:28.960
Gracias.
